OL,3,GNEWSAIncoming councils eye tourism tax
OL,4,Ato boost funds
OL,5,
OL,6,FSurrey's two new unitary authorities
OL,7,Fare considering a tourism tax to help
OL,8,Fbuoy their finances.
OL,10,FThis "overnight visitor levy", which
OL,11,Fregional mayors will be allowed to
OL,12,Fcharge under government plans, could
OL,13,Fcome to the county as part of a major
OL,14,Foverhaul of its councils.
OL,16,FEast and West Surrey councils are set
OL,17,Fto take over power from Surrey County
OL,18,FCouncil and the 11 district councils
OL,19,Fnext April, after which they plan to
OL,20,Fpool resources on certain services.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
