OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAIncoming councils eye tourism tax
OL,4,Ato boost funds
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government spokesperson said the levy
OL,7,Fwould "ensure local people and
OL,8,Feconomies keep more of the rewards and
OL,9,Finvest in what matters most to their
OL,10,Fcommunities, including reinvesting back
OL,11,Finto tourism itself".
